  "schema:description": "The gravity station data (5,905 records) were compiled by the U. S. Geological Survey. This data base was received on July 11, 1997. Principal gravity parameters include observed gravity, Free-air anomalies and Bouguer anomalies. The Bouguer gravity anomaly values were computed using the 1967 gravity formula (International Association of Geodesy, 1971). See Open-File Report 90-265 for further information.\n\nPurpose: To provide easy access to global and regional gravity data and related models for scientific studies.",
  "schema:creativeWorkStatus": "completed",
